# Only send the workspace crates (and the root manifest + lockfile, which the
# simulated-device image builds against) to the Docker daemon
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!supervictor/common/
!supervictor/edge/
!supervictor/endpoint/

# Exclude build artifacts and secrets within those dirs
**/target/
**/.logs/
**/*.md
**/.env*
**/certs/
supervictor/endpoint/tests/
